  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEirAu3syS7PTgmWmzk70D6RsRns22ulycAAkiXDTxx9VHRDib5gA31GH1aSkLnMfUNDis5rXtPkjBClkUF0pyy-O9wi_xTN-1DixTQxtRJTd8cCf8PBHbo5a6yk7aKkcBVwbPL1x0mH32u8IwGRgQ7P7uX22pmUit_GUkzL1FpuMqygJONOwfCmenBykg/s2000/2.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1351\" data-original-width=\"2000\" height=\"432\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEirAu3syS7PTgmWmzk70D6RsRns22ulycAAkiXDTxx9VHRDib5gA31GH1aSkLnMfUNDis5rXtPkjBClkUF0pyy-O9wi_xTN-1DixTQxtRJTd8cCf8PBHbo5a6yk7aKkcBVwbPL1x0mH32u8IwGRgQ7P7uX22pmUit_GUkzL1FpuMqygJONOwfCmenBykg/w640-h432/2.png\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjrldw8BuR87slPkQdfZoyGM9ehTQNQ7DhT5TWcTX2qc1X8mSbYvcg6ta1RgFQXqL9fcpHSt9ugTxZUKAo4nZPVMyDU2-WDMR_lBk1WlrZ96SjSlgVYC0_RltR6sD0DChXqgc2yjohFnjspg_H6_A3Tdbrl5Ry066HfZkDbB4l91b-SlLTb-dPctseBhg/s1424/344%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjrldw8BuR87slPkQdfZoyGM9ehTQNQ7DhT5TWcTX2qc1X8mSbYvcg6ta1RgFQXqL9fcpHSt9ugTxZUKAo4nZPVMyDU2-WDMR_lBk1WlrZ96SjSlgVYC0_RltR6sD0DChXqgc2yjohFnjspg_H6_A3Tdbrl5Ry066HfZkDbB4l91b-SlLTb-dPctseBhg/w450-h640/344%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作品名稱</span></b></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span>「語言平權政策」</span><span>提案連署</span></span></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作品說明：</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮ǹg望各縣市ê縣市長參選人，未來tī教育kap社會政策頂頭，mā ē用得兼顧台灣本土價值kap國際視野，m̄-nā為母語囡仔，mā為所有學生、家長kap市民，打造koh-khah語言友善kap文化融合ê教育hām生活環境，落實「國家語言發展法」中，「語言平權」以及「多元文化」ê精神，hōo各縣市ê校園kap社會，thang親像語言學者Garcia所描述--ê，tsiânn做「百花齊開ê語言花園」。<br /><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">封面圖ê設計者：N̂g Bí-hôa、郭白欣，支持台灣多語文化ê台語阿母。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>「語言平權連署書」</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台文版：</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://forms.gle/VJKTFoSNHybhN6Fv5\" target=\"_blank\">https://forms.gle/VJKTFoSNHybhN6Fv5</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">華文版：</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://forms.gle/Sz7gmjxBYsJ62T7R6\" target=\"_blank\">https://forms.gle/Sz7gmjxBYsJ62T7R6</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>承諾書手牌仔下載</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">傳統白話字版本</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://reurl.cc/VRjQbY\" target=\"_blank\">https://reurl.cc/VRjQbY</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">教育部台羅版本</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://reurl.cc/85WLxg\" target=\"_blank\">https://reurl.cc/85WLxg</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">華文版本</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://reurl.cc/mZG4O7\" target=\"_blank\">https://reurl.cc/mZG4O7</a></span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></p><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7EsEvYcOny0uZTPG13xlE&amp;__tn__